### Legacy API replaced but without backwards compatibility
<details><summary>Expand</summary>

Neither of the removed functions were used in the Zephyr repository except within their tests, but may be required by external projects.  Because the new API cannot be accessed from userspace functionally equivalent API is provided with new names and types.

#### Removed functions

```
