> Because the action is not atomic with the state update, we'd need to introduce transient states e.g. IDLE to QUEUING to QUEUED with or without CANCEL happening at any point in the sequence. This causes a state explosion and a frightfully complicated transition diagram.

Suggest extend existing bits to express the transition states.
